    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "The Dark Altar can enchant items using certain ingredients, soul energy, and the ritual caster's own experience levels."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "The rituals can enchant even enchanted items, so long as the item's enchantments are compatible with the enchantment, and can increase the level enchantment as well. However, when increasing the enchantment level, the experience level required is doubled."
